    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table \u2014 and a voice that doesn\u2019t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces \u2014 each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t be told what to do.<br>But you\u2019ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices \u2014 playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table \u2014 and a voice that doesn\u2019t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces \u2014 each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t be told what to do.<br>But you\u2019ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices \u2014 playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>",
